# Spotify OAuth credentials and local runtime state
.spotify_token.json
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Local Spotify playlist manager credentials, permissions, backups and audit log
.spotify_playlist_token.json
.spotify_playlist_manager.json
playlist_backups/
playlist_manager_audit.jsonl

# Local lyrics cache and phrase index (personal runtime data)
data/lyrics/*.sqlite3
data/lyrics/*.sqlite3-wal
data/lyrics/*.sqlite3-shm

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FILE OVERVIEW
# Purpose: Keep credentials, local runtime state, caches, and private/generated
#          artifacts out of version control.
# Scope: Rules above cover Spotify OAuth tokens, playlist-manager state/backups,
#        Python bytecode, and the local lyrics database plus SQLite sidecars.
# Maintenance: Add new local secrets, caches, and machine-specific runtime files
#              here; do not ignore canonical source archives or intentional outputs.
# Related: See .github/README.md, data/README.md, and assistant_data/README.md.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
